Go modules
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Binaries of arca statically link the Go modules listed in go.mod. They are
distributed under the MIT, BSD-3-Clause and Apache-2.0 licenses, each of which
requires that its copyright notice travel with the binary. A complete,
generated list of those modules and their license texts is attached to every
GitHub release as THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.

To regenerate it from a checkout:

    make licenses

